      "cat-harness:section": "(header)",
      "prov:value": "> **Owner statement, 2026-09-20, recorded on bean `yj32`.** This page is the\n> settled part of it. The parts that are still the owner's to decide are in\n> §\"Open, and named rather than guessed\" — they are not written as if decided,\n> because a guessed answer in a published document is how a wrong one becomes\n> canon.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean yj32",
        "2026-09-20"
